#- §6╔═.§b❄§6.════════╗
§5    Last Christmas?
§6╚════════.§b❄§6.═╝
§8We believed that last Christmas would be our last Christmas... And it was! And we remember it. Well, some of us do. We also believe this Christmas will be our last Christmas. And now we find ourselves here... 
uncertain... waiting...
#- §8Some of us now live in a bizarre limbo of sorts. §0The Darkness§8 did not take us (§oyet§0§8) even though we persuaded ourselves it was fast approaching.

Some have been preparing for the worst. Like myself and §5ɨȶ§8, for example. Now bound in more ways
#- §8than one. No longer just fates design. We share our minds in the hope that together we may figure out the secrets of this world before the inevitable end. Before we are forced to begin anew.

§7I'm no longer alone... and yet I feel more alone than ever.
#- §8§oPeople still missing. Things changing. 
Time running out.§0

§8I recall last Christmas, which should not be possible as that was in another lifetime. I remember people that I've never met. I see the faces of those I know now, only differently... Blissfully ignorant.
#- §8I can vividly recreate the moment of joy as I was given my 1st Witch Hat...

Wait... 

why didn't I have a hat already? I've been a Witch all my life, haven't I? All my life? Lives? My head hurts. Maybe it's the cold winter wind...
#- §8Or... maybe it's the entity I let wander inside my brain? 
The toxic waste and spores on Deathcap? §0The Darkness§8 knocking at my door? The many spells that backfired? The CEO? Let's be honest, the list is rather long!

My memory serves me well. This... I know...
#- §8We were happier then. Things were simple. I don't recall §5ɨȶ §8being in my life either. We all sang songs, warm around the fireplace with a piano that was not stuck on repeat. 
I        WAS        NOT... 
'stuck on repeat'.
That's what I felt. Now I see the truth and that we are all nothing but a broken record.
#- §8Spinning in the endless vortex between worlds. How can I ever feel the Christmas spirit, when every Christmas could be my last?
§5Wₒw Scᵣₒₒgₑ, 
lᵢghtₑN tHₑ mₒₒd!
yₒᵤ wₒᵤldn't Sₐy thₐt ₐbₒᵤt HₐllₒwₑₑN...
§6Halloween is the 
only thing that makes sense for us...
#-     §6Sweetpea §c& §5ɨȶ'ֆ
